:\"Floating assistant panel width\",\"description\":\"Project-owned outer floating chat panel width in pixels. In assistant mode, adjust this for a wider/narrower chat area; AppUIModel controls only the inner layout. The panel remains clamped to the viewport.\",\"intents\":[\"make chat area wider\",\"change floating assistant width\",\"聊天区域太窄，调宽一点\",\"调整悬浮聊天面板宽度\"]},{\"id\":\"conversation.starter-suggestions\",\"kind\":\"application_config\",\"name\":\"Conversation starter suggestions\",\"description\":\"Application-owned starter questions shown in the empty conversation state.\",\"intents\":[\"change starter questions\",\"edit suggested prompts\",\"customize empty-state suggestions\",\"modify example questions\",\"修改推荐问题\",\"修改开场问题\"],\"relatedPluginIds\":[\"conversation-suggestions\"]},{\"id\":\"conversation.welcome\",\"kind\":\"application_config\",\"name\":\"Conversation welcome content\",\"description\":\"Application-owned welcome title and description for an empty conversation.\",\"intents\":[\"change welcome text\",\"edit conversation welcome title\",\"customize empty-state welcome copy\",\"修改欢迎语\",\"修改欢迎标题和说明\"],\"relatedPluginIds\":[\"conversation-surface\"]},{\"id\":\"theme.brand-palette\",\"kind\":\"application_config\",\"name\":\"Agent UI brand colors and visual styling\",\"description\":\"Customize Agent UI brand colors, surfaces, radius and shadows in this project stylesheet. Use public theme tokens and scoped CSS overrides. Ordinary scoped application CSS editing needs no source takeover. Preserve npm imports, vendor and Host CSS. Presets are light/dark/violet; blue is a palette, not a preset.\",\"intents\":[\"change brand colors\",\"customize theme palette\",\"make the assistant blue and white\",\"simplify visual styling\",\"紫色换蓝白配色\",\"企业配色，整体简洁一点\"],\"relatedPluginIds\":[\"theme-provider\"]},{\"id\":\"plugin-source:add-attachment-action\",\"kind\":\"plugin_source\",\"name\":\"Conversation Add Attachment Action Plugin application\",\"relatedPluginId